      &lt;td style='width: 184px; height: 90px; font-weight: bold;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td colspan='3' rowspan='1' style='height: 90px; width: 291px;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;At least 11 people, including 10 river pirates, were killed and five policemen wounded Wednesday in a gun battle on a river island in Bangladesh, police said.The incident took place in an estuary of the river Meghna, Xinhua reported.The pirates abducted 20 fishermen and seized their boats&amp;nbsp;
